      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Search through an unsorted list with a quadratic speedup over classical ways. \n\n->Oracular approaches & phase flip oracle\n->Amplitude amplification\n->Grover algorithm\n",
