      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*Classical input: f(x)=y                     *Quantum input: A wavefct=> Superposition of quantum basis states\n                                                  2qubits: |Ψ>= c0*|00>+ c1*|01>+ c2*|10>+ c3*|11>\n                                                  nqubits: |Ψ>=∑ci* |i>   =>Superposition of all quantum basis states\n                                                                 i∈{0,1}**n",
      "fontSize": 44.32564362046029,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*Classical input: f(x)=y                     *Quantum input: A wavefct=> Superposition of quantum basis states\n                                                  2qubits: |Ψ>= c0*|00>+ c1*|01>+ c2*|10>+ c3*|11>\n                                                  nqubits: |Ψ>=∑ci* |i>   =>Superposition of all quantum basis states\n                                                                 i∈{0,1}**n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
