      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766853283644,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Uf: An oracle with the function f which describes our search problem.\n|y>= |->= 1/sqrt(2)* (|0>-|1>)\n\nUf|x>|->= Uf |x> (1/√2)(|0> - |1>)\n \n          = (1/sqrt(2))  (Uf |x> |0> - Uf |x> |1>)\n\n          = (1/sqrt(2))  (|x> |f(x)⊕0> - |x> |f(x)⊕1>)\n\n          = |x>  (1/sqrt(2))(|f(x)> - |f(x)⊕1>)\n\n          = |x>  (-1)**f(x) (1/√2)(|0> - |1>)\n\n          = (-1)**f(x) |x>  |->\n\n=> We have the following transformation:\n|x>|-> -----> (-1)**f(x) |x>|->",
      "fontSize": 44.32564362046029,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Uf: An oracle with the function f which describes our search problem.\n|y>= |->= 1/sqrt(2)* (|0>-|1>)\n\nUf|x>|->= Uf |x> (1/√2)(|0> - |1>)\n \n          = (1/sqrt(2))  (Uf |x> |0> - Uf |x> |1>)\n\n          = (1/sqrt(2))  (|x> |f(x)⊕0> - |x> |f(x)⊕1>)\n\n          = |x>  (1/sqrt(2))(|f(x)> - |f(x)⊕1>)\n\n          = |x>  (-1)**f(x) (1/√2)(|0> - |1>)\n\n          = (-1)**f(x) |x>  |->\n\n=> We have the following transformation:\n|x>|-> -----> (-1)**f(x) |x>|->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
