      "text": "We play a simple game: we start with a list of N elements\n                            Every element starting with value 1\n                            Some of the elements are marked \n\n                            Each game iteration has 2 phases:\n                            ->Query: every marked elt value sign is flipped\n                            ->Inversion:  the value of each element is reflected over the mean of all values.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
