    {
      "id": "PgPoVLerhudx3bBIN70u9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -162.8590649414068,
      "y": -1361.9642857142899,
      "width": 1438.2357177734375,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c15B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 799182622,
      "version": 303,
      "versionNonce": 1243243586,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766853547169,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We are given an unordered list. \nWe make a search of a specific element called as marked.\nWe have N elts in the list=> We need log2(N) qubits\nEach basis state |00...0>, |00...1>, ... , |11...1> represents a list entry\nWe access the list via an oracle: we can make queries to the list.\nSearched element detected=> oracle flips the sign of the corresponding amplitude.\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We are given an unordered list. \nWe make a search of a specific element called as marked.\nWe have N elts in the list=> We need log2(N) qubits\nEach basis state |00...0>, |00...1>, ... , |11...1> represents a list entry\nWe access the list via an oracle: we can make queries to the list.\nSearched element detected=> oracle flips the sign of the corresponding amplitude.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "D9WmbzmhAir2qz0_jBFvo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -175.90307128906306,
      "y": -1006.9642857142899,
      "width": 1179.32373046875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
